# =============================================================================
# ANCHOR — what is NOT committed.
#
# Note what is deliberately ABSENT from this file: eval/reports/*.md.
# The ablation table, the failure taxonomy and the judge-agreement report are
# COMMITTED ARTIFACTS — they are the evidence this repo exists to present, and
# a reviewer must be able to read them without running anything. Only the
# machine-readable JSON/JSONL alongside them is regenerated and ignored.
# =============================================================================

# The index: SQLite FTS5 database + the float32 vector matrix. Rebuilt in
# seconds by `anchor ingest`, so there is no reason to carry it in git.
data/

# Generated run output. The .md reports next to these ARE committed.
eval/reports/*.json
eval/reports/*.jsonl

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Environments and secrets. There is no .env in this repo and there never
# should be — every default runs with zero keys.
.venv/
venv/
.env

# Tool caches
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
